# Season / patch update pass

When the user asks to check for updates (or similar), **read and follow** the private checklist:

`.cursor/UPDATE-CHECKLIST.md`

Do not improvise a thinner pass. Work the list, use live sources (Epic news, Fortnite-API map, sprites API) before editing copy, skip sections that clearly do not apply, then report what changed vs what was already current.

Keep the checklist itself updated if you discover a new recurring stale surface (add a checkbox + file path).
